<h1>Privacy</h1>
<h2>Controller</h2>
<p>Omid Mohadjeri, Marchlewskistr. 111, 10243 Berlin, Germany<br>E-mail: <a href="mailto:hello@undercurent.com">hello@undercurent.com</a></p>
<h2>In short</h2>
<p>This website sets no cookies and uses no tracking or analytics. Fonts and video previews are loaded from our own server. Data only goes to third parties when you play a film yourself or send us an e-mail.</p>
<h2>Hosting</h2>
<p>This website is hosted on GitHub Pages (GitHub, Inc., 88 Colin P. Kelly Jr. Street, San Francisco, CA 94107, USA). When you visit, GitHub processes technically necessary data such as your IP address, the date and time, the page requested and your browser, in order to deliver the website and protect it from abuse. The legal basis is our legitimate interest in providing the website securely and reliably (Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR). Transfers to the USA are based on the EU-US Data Privacy Framework or the EU standard contractual clauses. More information: <a href="https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement" rel="noopener">GitHub’s privacy statement</a>.</p>
<h2>Videos from YouTube and Vimeo</h2>
<p>Our films are stored on YouTube (Google Ireland Limited, Gordon House, Barrow Street, Dublin 4, Ireland) or Vimeo (Vimeo.com, Inc., 330 West 34th Street, New York, NY 10001, USA). The player only loads when you click “Play the film”. Only then is a connection made to YouTube or Vimeo, which receive, among other things, your IP address and the page you visited, and may set cookies. For YouTube we use the privacy-enhanced mode. The legal basis is your consent given by the click (Art. 6(1)(a) GDPR, § 25(1) TDDDG). More information: <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" rel="noopener">Google’s privacy policy</a>, <a href="https://vimeo.com/privacy" rel="noopener">Vimeo’s privacy policy</a>.</p>
<h2>Contact by e-mail</h2>
<p>When you e-mail us, including through the contact field on the home page, which opens your e-mail program, we process your details to answer your request. The legal basis is Art. 6(1)(b) GDPR where your request relates to a contract, otherwise our legitimate interest in replying (Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR). We delete the data when it is no longer needed and no statutory retention periods apply.</p>
<h2>Fonts</h2>
<p>The fonts Fraunces and Familjen Grotesk are served from our own server. No connection is made to Google Fonts or any other font provider.</p>
<h2>Your rights</h2>
<p>You have the right to access, rectification, erasure, restriction of processing, data portability and objection, and the right to withdraw consent at any time. You can also complain to a data protection supervisory authority, for example the Berlin Commissioner for Data Protection and Freedom of Information.</p>
